WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.988
Gate G one has a short list, and each
line is a query, not an opinion.

2
00:00:04.988 --> 00:00:09.299
Groups and administrative units
match their registry, with no drift.

3
00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:14.300
The sign-in logs show no one outside
multifactor except the emergency accounts.

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.713
The emergency accounts
have recent, logged tests.

5
00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:21.012
The address inventory covers
the critical infrastructure.

6
00:00:21.012 --> 00:00:25.287
The provisioning logs show the HR feed
running for the foundation group.

7
00:00:25.287 --> 00:00:27.863
And high findings are
fixed and re-scanned.

8
00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:31.376
The steward decides, but only
after the data says green.

9
00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:32.690
So what can go wrong?
